# The marketplace release private key must NEVER be committed. The root
# .gitignore already excludes *.pem; this is belt-and-braces so a future
# change to that rule cannot accidentally expose the signing key.
#
# In CI the private key comes from a repository secret, written to a temp
# file outside the tree. Locally it is generated here for dev signing.
*.pem
marketplace-dev.*
!marketplace-pub.ed25519.b64
!marketplace-pub.ed25519.pem
